/* ===========================================================================
   Geroscope — evidence-based longevity intervention dataset
   ~126 interventions across 12 categories, compiled from a 7-agent web-research
   sweep (2023-2026 sources) and scored on one consistent rubric.

   Component scores (0-100), curated for cross-item comparability:
     evi  = Evidence strength   (rigor/reproducibility of the BEST available study,
                                  any species: human RCT-hard > RCT-surrogate >
                                  cohort > ITP mouse lifespan > other animal >
                                  in-vitro > mechanistic)
     hum  = Human translation   (how well benefit is shown IN HUMANS specifically)
     imp  = Impact              (magnitude of effect on lifespan/healthspan WHERE
                                  shown; null/harmful effects score low even if
                                  well-studied)
     safe = Safety              (higher = safer at the relevant dose)

   Overall promise (computed in app.js):
     overall = 0.30*evi + 0.28*hum + 0.22*imp + 0.20*safe
   Tiers: S >=78 · A 68-77 · B 56-67 · C 44-55 · D <44
   =========================================================================== */
